flowchart TD
    R["Refresh the materialized view"] --> Q{"What changed?"}
    Q -->|"First run, or the definition changed"| F["COMPLETE_RECOMPUTE<br/>last_refresh_type RECOMPUTED"]
    Q -->|"New rows in the streaming table"| I["GROUP_AGGREGATE<br/>last_refresh_type INCREMENTAL"]
    Q -->|"Nothing changed"| N["NO_OP<br/>last_refresh_type NO OPERATION"]
